OL,3,GNEWSA'Grace is proof all schools need
OL,4,Aepilepsy training'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was terrifying," said mum Lyndsey,
OL,7,Frecalling five-year-old Grace's first
OL,8,Fin a series of seizures that would lead
OL,9,Fto an epilepsy diagnosis.
OL,11,FAs Grace learnt to live with the
OL,12,Fneurological condition, Lyndsey said
OL,13,Fthe prospect of how it may impact her
OL,14,Fschool life in Par, Cornwall, was
OL,15,Fdaunting.
OL,17,FBut Lyndsey's fears were allayed when
OL,18,Fthe school said it would train all its
OL,19,Fteachers to respond to seizures and
OL,20,Fdispense emergency medication.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
